  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Language lab- Sveti Sava Elementary School- Klokot</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Language lab- Sveti Sava Elementary School- Klokot</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;i&#x165; kvalitu vzdel&#xe1;vacieho procesu, v&#xfd;u&#x10d;bu cudz&#xed;ch jazykov pre deti nav&#x161;tevuj&#xfa;ce Z&#xe1;kladn&#xfa; &#x161;kolu v Klokote. Projekt navrhuje vytvorenie jednej triedy a potrebn&#xe9; je zak&#xfa;pi&#x165; z&#xe1;kladn&#xe9; vybavenie ako stoly, stoli&#x10d;ky, osobn&#xfd; po&#x10d;&#xed;ta&#x10d; a tla&#x10d;iare&#x148;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to create an English Language Lab at the Sveti Sava Elementary School in Klokot, Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
